"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about content that is <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inaccessible\" title=\"Category:Inaccessible\">inaccessible</a> through normal gameplay</b>. It can still be accessed via in-game exploits or third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Mental Debilitation</b> is a passive feature that mentally exhausts attacking foes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When the wearer succeeds a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> against any foe's spells or actions, that foe gains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Fatigue_(Condition)\" title=\"Mental Fatigue (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mental Fatigue\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Fatigue_(Condition)\" title=\"Mental Fatigue (Condition)\">Mental Fatigue</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Mental_Fatigue\"> Condition: Mental Fatigue </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Fatigue_(Condition)\" title=\"Mental Fatigue (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mental Fatigue\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Fatigue_(Condition)\" title=\"Mental Fatigue (Condition)\">Mental Fatigue</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has a -1 penalty to <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">saving throws</a> for every turn remaining.</li>\n<li>When it fails a Wisdom, Intelligence, or Charisma saving throw while having 5 or more turns of this condition remaining, the entity takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a><abbr title=\"Damage Rider As Source\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">DRS</a></abbr> damage and is no longer mentally fatigued.</li>\n<li>Mental Fatigue has a maximum <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 7 turns.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Braindrain_Cape\" title=\"Braindrain Cape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Braindrain_Cape_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Braindrain_Cape_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Braindrain_Cape_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Braindrain_Cape_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Braindrain_Cape_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Braindrain_Cape_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Braindrain_Cape_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Braindrain_Cape_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Braindrain_Cape_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Braindrain_Cape\" title=\"Braindrain Cape\">Braindrain Cape</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202247\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1712/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20852/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4235/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1601/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1026297/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   67.445      1 -total\n 64.09%   43.222      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 35.86%   24.185      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 35.24%   23.769      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 34.13%   23.020      1 Template:Ambox\n 14.41%    9.717      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 12.74%    8.594      1 Template:Condition\n 11.75%    7.926      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 10.65%    7.180      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n  9.27%    6.253      3 Template:Icon_text\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30969-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202247 and revision id 165757. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}